{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109084907855-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109090940\"/><p>龍翔道有兩私家車相撞。</p><p>黃大仙發生交通意外。今日(9日)早上8時08分，兩私家車沿龍翔道往觀塘方向行駛，至新光中心對開時意外相撞，事件中一名司機手部受傷送院治理，肇事原因有待調查。受意外影響，往觀塘方向交通受阻。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，龍翔道(往觀塘方向)近黃大仙港鐵站的部分行車線仍然封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，現時上址交通擠塞。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.638818+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T00:49:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.918924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.120558+00:00","content_hash":"f6cc4d5fc7495d48e2676da5be30cd3595f3588d8f4e66648e9860ac3a771fc3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.638818+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}